  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme Inclusive Transformation for Youth and Child-Friendly Local Governance in Uzbekistan aims to strengthen the inclusiveness, transparency, and responsiveness of local governance systems by empowering local authorities to strategically plan, budget, and deliver services in line with the needs of vulnerable groups, particularly children, youth, women, the elderly, and people with disabilities. Through a results-based management (RBM) and results-based budgeting (RBB) approach,</narrative>
